# Upload list for `vercel deploy` run from the repository root. The dashboard's
# Root Directory is packages/dashboard, but the whole workspace has to travel:
# pnpm resolves `workspace:*` against the root lockfile, and the build does
# `cd ../..` to reach it.
#
# What is excluded is what the build regenerates or never reads. `target/` alone
# is 11G of Rust artifacts against ~100M for everything else.

target/
node_modules/
.git/
.turbo/
dist/
coverage/
mutants.out/
mutants.out.old/
.surfpool/
test-ledger/
.anchor/
.next/
*.tsbuildinfo
